WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.359 --> 00:00:02.550
Guten Nachmittag, Freunde!

00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:05.100
Welcome back to SCP Explained.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:10.160
World War II is one of the most tragic periods
of recent history, and perhaps the defining

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:12.059
event of the 20th Century.

00:00:12.059 --> 00:00:17.700
And not only was this conflict a horrifying
atrocity that led to the deaths of 75 million

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:23.230
soldiers and civilians, it was also a time
of immense weirdness.

00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:27.830
The American Military created the “Ghost
Army”, a tactical deception unit that used

00:00:27.830 --> 00:00:33.970
tactics as crazy as inflatable tanks and wooden
airfields to distract and confuse the Axis

00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:34.970
powers.

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:39.710
They also temporarily renamed hamburgers “Liberty
Steaks” in some places in order to avoid

00:00:39.710 --> 00:00:43.010
the German connotations of the original name.

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:47.910
The Polish military even gave an actual bear
the rank of Corporal, and this bear - named

00:00:47.910 --> 00:00:54.800
Corporal Wojtek - became a decorated military
hero, but enough about SCP-5464, we’ve got

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:59.260
bigger fish - or, well, bears - to fry.

00:00:59.260 --> 00:01:04.360
One party in this war had more than their
fair share of alleged World War II weirdness:

00:01:04.360 --> 00:01:05.750
The Germans.

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:10.440
Nazi scientists were performing horrifying
and nonsensical experiments - from medical

00:01:10.440 --> 00:01:16.110
experiments on prisoners to attempts to create
large and ridiculous weapons known as Wunderwaffe.

00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:20.440
One of Hitler’s right-hand men, Heinrich
Himmler, took up residence in a castle where

00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:26.869
he and his men allegedly performed odd occult
rituals, and even the Lebensborn, a deranged

00:01:26.869 --> 00:01:32.280
eugenics experiment intended to produce a
huge stock of Aryan children from SS-member

00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:33.479
fathers.

00:01:33.479 --> 00:01:38.590
And if all of that seems certifiably insane
- which, for the record, it is - then the

00:01:38.590 --> 00:01:43.150
stuff the SCP Foundation has been suppressing
will make your toes curl.

00:01:43.150 --> 00:01:47.390
We’ve already covered the fact that even
Hitler himself, copied by Stalin with the

00:01:47.390 --> 00:01:53.420
help of Sarkic wizards, is now classified
as SCP-2430 and held in containment by the

00:01:53.420 --> 00:01:54.420
Foundation.

00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:56.970
But really, that’s just the tip of the iceberg.

00:01:56.970 --> 00:02:02.320
We can thank a shady group known as the Obskuracorps
for the creation or utilization of a lot of

00:02:02.320 --> 00:02:04.850
these artifacts and entities.

00:02:04.850 --> 00:02:10.140
As we discussed in our video on the Immortal
Hitler Clone, the Obskuracorps was Nazi Germany’s

00:02:10.140 --> 00:02:14.800
answer to the SCP Foundation, though their
highly unethical methods were much more like

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:18.200
a racist version of the Chaos Insurgency.

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:22.660
This group of loyal occult thugs was charged
with hunting down any anomalous artifacts

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:26.120
that would give Germany the edge it needed
in the war effort.

00:02:26.120 --> 00:02:30.140
Think the kind of guys going after the Ark
of the Covenant and the Holy Grail while trying

00:02:30.140 --> 00:02:32.180
to kill Indiana Jones.

00:02:32.180 --> 00:02:35.920
Of course, seeing as Germany still lost the
war in the end, they weren’t exactly the

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:37.069
best at their job.

00:02:37.069 --> 00:02:41.400
But that doesn’t mean they don’t have
a long list of bizarre and often dangerous

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:43.660
anomalies to their name.

00:02:43.660 --> 00:02:46.580
Starting with SCP-2367.

00:02:46.580 --> 00:02:51.090
This is a device so infamous that not even
the SCP Foundation has been able to fully

00:02:51.090 --> 00:02:53.819
suppress knowledge of its existence.

00:02:53.819 --> 00:02:57.810
Popularly known as “Die Glocke”, meaning
“The Bell” in German, this device has

00:02:57.810 --> 00:03:02.620
been a popular staple among time travel and
alien conspiracy theorists.

00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:06.020
And those theorists honestly aren’t that
far from the truth.

00:03:06.020 --> 00:03:10.840
The Bell is a spatial and temporal transportation
device created by the Germans during World

00:03:10.840 --> 00:03:16.390
War II in hopes of teleporting spies, soldiers,
and equipment behind enemy lines.

00:03:16.390 --> 00:03:22.590
And terrifyingly, the machine actually worked
and was able to transport multiple SS officers.

00:03:22.590 --> 00:03:28.041
However, there is one detail that makes Die
Glocke a little less terrifying: Everything

00:03:28.041 --> 00:03:33.860
they transport materializes several hundred
feet over the top of their intended destinations.

00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:38.040
In the case of all transported SS Officers,
this meant that they appeared high in the

00:03:38.040 --> 00:03:41.480
air and immediately fell to their doom like
Wile E. Coyote.

00:03:41.480 --> 00:03:46.810
SS Officers hitting the ground at incredibly
high speeds is always a delightful mental

00:03:46.810 --> 00:03:47.900
image.

00:03:47.900 --> 00:03:54.970
As funny and incompetent as this is, there
is actually one major threat posed by SCP-2367.

00:03:54.970 --> 00:03:59.670
The SCP Foundation raided a number of Obskura
strongholds during World War II as part of

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:02.630
an operation cal led Operation Hammer.

00:04:02.630 --> 00:04:07.659
During one of their raids, a large group of
around 1400 German soldiers, along with a

00:04:07.659 --> 00:04:12.599
huge number of large vehicles and pieces of
military equipment, fled via Die Glocke.

00:04:12.599 --> 00:04:16.639
They all disappeared through the teleporter,
and according to all Foundation estimates,

00:04:16.639 --> 00:04:19.849
they’re likely to manifest again in 2031.

00:04:19.849 --> 00:04:24.740
They’ll rain down from the sky near Berlin,
crushing everything below under the weight

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:27.139
of their own vehicles and bodies.

00:04:27.139 --> 00:04:32.499
A Mobile Task Force, nicknamed Himmler's Housekeepers,
has been mobilized to clear the area and reduce

00:04:32.499 --> 00:04:36.210
all possible civilian fatalities when this
happens.

00:04:36.210 --> 00:04:38.849
German engineering at its finest, right?

00:04:38.849 --> 00:04:43.460
But hey, let’s give those mad Nazi inventors
another chance to prove themselves with a

00:04:43.460 --> 00:04:48.219
second, even bigger Wunderwaffe designed by
Albert Speer, German Minister of Armaments

00:04:48.219 --> 00:04:50.969
and War Production under Adolf Hitler.

00:04:50.969 --> 00:04:55.249
It’s SCP-044, the biggest artillery weapon
ever created.

00:04:55.249 --> 00:05:03.169
It’s a ginormous cannon, 251,000 kg, or
251 metric tonnes in weight, and so huge that

00:05:03.169 --> 00:05:07.270
it required two freight locomotives at the
same time to transport it.

00:05:07.270 --> 00:05:12.779
The Nazis were big fans of absurdly huge weapons,
whether they were cannons, giant planes, or

00:05:12.779 --> 00:05:17.409
the world’s heaviest tanks - almost as though
they were compensating for something - but

00:05:17.409 --> 00:05:22.840
there is one thing that makes 044 special
to the point of being anomalous: It can fire

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:25.069
literally anything.

00:05:25.069 --> 00:05:30.479
When something is placed inside the firing
chamber of SCP-044, the weapon will transform

00:05:30.479 --> 00:05:35.050
it into a powerful explosive payload, with
its explosive power being proportional to

00:05:35.050 --> 00:05:37.960
the size of the objects placed inside.

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:42.400
Even crowds of people could be transformed
into deadly explosive rounds.

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:46.369
One of the largest objects that the Foundation
fired off was the Administrator’s diesel

00:05:46.369 --> 00:05:49.889
pickup truck, weighing 8,900 kg.

00:05:49.889 --> 00:05:54.499
How on earth did the Nazis ever lose with
a weapon like this on their side, right?

00:05:54.499 --> 00:06:00.010
Well, much like so many of their other weapons,
it was a victim of their own greed: Weapons

00:06:00.010 --> 00:06:04.669
this big just couldn’t be moved practically
and were easily routed by less powerful but

00:06:04.669 --> 00:06:07.169
more maneuverable Allied weapons.

00:06:07.169 --> 00:06:12.490
Next, we have another anomalous Nazi failure,
though this one was intended to give life

00:06:12.490 --> 00:06:14.460
rather than take it for once.

00:06:14.460 --> 00:06:21.119
The anomaly in question is SCP-2936, a secret
Nazi military and research base hidden in

00:06:21.119 --> 00:06:23.430
the cold reaches of Antarctica.

00:06:23.430 --> 00:06:28.710
The place has likely been abandoned by humans
since the 1950s, but there is one entity that

00:06:28.710 --> 00:06:32.490
still rolls through the halls on rumbling
caterpillar tracks.

00:06:32.490 --> 00:06:38.509
An advanced sentient robot nicknamed the Stahlmutter,
or Steel Mother, powered by a mysterious power

00:06:38.509 --> 00:06:42.279
source shaped like an ambiguous glowing symbol
on its chest.

00:06:42.279 --> 00:06:46.289
Who would have guessed that the Nazi design
sensibility was tacky?

00:06:46.289 --> 00:06:51.889
The Stahlmutter is there to maintain the Glasgebärmuttern,
or glass wombs, where a number of desiccated

00:06:51.889 --> 00:06:54.059
human fetuses are held.

00:06:54.059 --> 00:06:58.969
The intention of this base was clear - much
like the Lebensborn project we mentioned at

00:06:58.969 --> 00:07:04.059
the start of the video, this was a controlled
breeding program supported by the Nazi’s

00:07:04.059 --> 00:07:06.809
deranged philosophy of eugenics.

00:07:06.809 --> 00:07:11.520
But after the war, when the Nazis attending
the base presumably fled for their lives,

00:07:11.520 --> 00:07:16.800
there was some kind of accident that destroyed
the seal of the glass wombs, allowing the

00:07:16.800 --> 00:07:20.789
amniotic fluids to leak out and killing the
fetuses inside.

00:07:20.789 --> 00:07:26.619
But, due to a malfunction, the Stahlmutter’s
diagnostics were way off, and it never realized

00:07:26.619 --> 00:07:28.669
that its mission was futile.

00:07:28.669 --> 00:07:33.069
When researchers attempted to inform the machine
of that fact, it simply replied:

00:07:33.069 --> 00:07:37.419
“The children lie on the bottoms of their
Glasgebärmuttern.

00:07:37.419 --> 00:07:40.379
They are unmoving, like the dead soldiers.

00:07:40.379 --> 00:07:47.979
But the children are not soldiers, and the
children are not Untermenschen.

00:07:47.979 --> 00:07:51.539
And the chemical, physical, and mechanical
parameters of the Glasgebärmuttern are all

00:07:51.539 --> 00:07:53.330
at optimal values.

00:07:53.330 --> 00:07:57.680
Therefore, the children are not dead.

00:07:57.680 --> 00:08:00.199
The Stahlmutter loves the children always.

00:08:00.199 --> 00:08:04.289
Good children will grow strong and brave and
wise.

00:08:04.289 --> 00:08:07.649
The Stahlmutter loves the good children.”

00:08:07.649 --> 00:08:14.069
The next anomaly wasn’t created by the Germans
or the Obskura, but it was utilized by them.

00:08:14.069 --> 00:08:20.430
It’s SCP-3457, a collection of strange rituals,
artifacts, and workings known as the Rites

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:21.550
of Solomon.

00:08:21.550 --> 00:08:25.879
If the correct artifacts are collected and
the rites are performed, the executors of

00:08:25.879 --> 00:08:31.159
the ritual have the ability to control the
distribution of magic, or thaumaturgy, across

00:08:31.159 --> 00:08:32.159
the globe.

00:08:32.159 --> 00:08:36.550
Its Obskura’s plan to perform the rite,
and remove the ability to perform thaumaturgy

00:08:36.550 --> 00:08:42.690
from anyone who wasn’t of Germanic descent,
giving them German magic supremacy.

00:08:42.690 --> 00:08:47.649
This was the end of the infamous Seventh Occult
War, which was the major geopolitical event

00:08:47.649 --> 00:08:52.790
that led to the formation of the Global Occult
Coalition, coinciding roughly with what we

00:08:52.790 --> 00:08:55.360
civilians consider World War II.

00:08:55.360 --> 00:09:00.120
Luckily, through a collaboration between the
SCP Foundation and the precursor to the Global

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:06.019
Occult Coalition, the Allied Occult Coalition,
Obskura were defeated before they could complete

00:09:06.019 --> 00:09:10.100
the ritual and grant magical supremacy for
the Fatherland.

00:09:10.100 --> 00:09:15.560
Since the defeat of Obskura in this pivotal
battle, organizations like the SCP Foundation,

00:09:15.560 --> 00:09:20.449
the GOC, and others have sworn to keep the
different artifacts necessary to perform the

00:09:20.449 --> 00:09:23.410
Rites of Solomon safe and secure.

00:09:23.410 --> 00:09:27.649
Some are kept in public museums as part of
a global sting operation to catch remaining

00:09:27.649 --> 00:09:32.900
members of Obskura, who hope to someday attempt
the dark ritual again.

00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:37.140
Some of the items remain in the hands of scattered
Obskura remnants to this day.

00:09:37.140 --> 00:09:42.620
Okay, so arcane historical rites are a little
complicated, let’s hop back to another wacky

00:09:42.620 --> 00:09:45.300
Wunderwaffe to cleanse our palette.

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:49.399
Something like SCP-3721.

00:09:49.399 --> 00:09:53.029
Remember when we said the Germans were kind
of obsessed with having the biggest, gaudiest

00:09:53.029 --> 00:09:55.100
guns back during World War II?

00:09:55.100 --> 00:10:00.519
They were also apparently ahead of their time
in this regard, as in 1943, they were able

00:10:00.519 --> 00:10:05.910
to construct a fully operational orbital cannon
and an earthbound computer bank that allowed

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:08.100
them to operate its strikes remotely.

00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:13.879
But, even scarier than a giant orbital cannon
controlled by the Nazis is a giant orbital

00:10:13.879 --> 00:10:16.610
cannon that’s completely out of control.

00:10:16.610 --> 00:10:21.720
That’s right: The computer on the ground
is autonomous and decides the best time to

00:10:21.720 --> 00:10:25.910
make its strike by monitoring news broadcasts
of current events.

00:10:25.910 --> 00:10:30.420
So if you feel like a day full of bad news
is unpleasant, just be grateful that it wasn’t

00:10:30.420 --> 00:10:34.459
the day that activated the massive death satellite
looming up above.

00:10:34.459 --> 00:10:39.060
Maybe the idea of the land being bombarded
by an orbital cannon freaks you out a little.

00:10:39.060 --> 00:10:40.579
Understandable, really.

00:10:40.579 --> 00:10:43.350
Maybe you’d prefer to flee to the water
for safety.

00:10:43.350 --> 00:10:47.089
But you’re not safe from the Germans there,
either - and we’re not just talking about

00:10:47.089 --> 00:10:50.510
them stealing your beach chairs while you’re
going for a swim.

00:10:50.510 --> 00:10:57.300
We’re talking about SCP-4217, which was
once known as the Bismarck, which was a German

00:10:57.300 --> 00:11:02.860
WW2 battleship before it was appropriated
by a giant cephalopod that not only has giant,

00:11:02.860 --> 00:11:07.350
dangerous tentacles but also has the ability
to use all of the ship’s weapons against

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:09.000
you, too.

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:11.360
What will you think of next, Germany?

00:11:11.360 --> 00:11:16.740
And finally, perhaps the strangest Obskura
Wunderwaffe of all: A dangerous semantic weapon

00:11:16.740 --> 00:11:18.810
known as SCP-3878.

00:11:18.810 --> 00:11:25.899
It’s a deadly, word-based, infectious cognitohazard
created in a single Patient Zero via a strict

00:11:25.899 --> 00:11:32.160
regimen of psychotropic drugs, electroconvulsive
therapy, and at the conclusion of the program,

00:11:32.160 --> 00:11:37.449
trepanation to create an extremely strong
anti-concept within the subject's mind.

00:11:37.449 --> 00:11:43.310
When this person is activated with a trigger
stimuli, they will begin to spread the cognitohazard,

00:11:43.310 --> 00:11:48.610
causing a lethal effect to anyone who doesn’t
speak the subject’s native language fluently.

00:11:48.610 --> 00:11:53.389
The first infectee would have been German
if the plan came to fruition, so all but fluent

00:11:53.389 --> 00:11:56.230
German speakers would have been killed by
the infection.

00:11:56.230 --> 00:11:58.259
It’s a solid plan.

00:11:58.259 --> 00:12:01.399
By which we mean, a Metal Gear Solid plan.

00:12:01.399 --> 00:12:06.129
Incidentally, killing the victims of this
cognitohazard was never actually the plan,

00:12:06.129 --> 00:12:08.730
they just hoped to erase other languages.

00:12:08.730 --> 00:12:12.910
Though given that the Nazis weren’t exactly
people of high moral fiber, we’d be willing

00:12:12.910 --> 00:12:17.490
to bet they were probably a-okay with killing
everyone who wasn’t a fluent speaker of

00:12:17.490 --> 00:12:19.120
German anyway.

00:12:19.120 --> 00:12:23.259
And there you have it - a taster plate of
the wackiest Wunderwaffe and the sinister

00:12:23.259 --> 00:12:28.499
soldiers and scientists who made them a reality,
or at least tried to twist them to their own

00:12:28.499 --> 00:12:29.499
gain.

00:12:29.499 --> 00:12:33.709
It’s honestly lucky for all of us that the
Nazis during World War II were a gang of arrogant

00:12:33.709 --> 00:12:38.680
and incompetent buffoons, because if that
weren’t the case, we’d probably be speaking

00:12:38.680 --> 00:12:40.199
German right now.

00:12:40.199 --> 00:12:45.459
Though if you like to live on the bright side,
at least we’d be safe from SCP-3878!

00:12:45.459 --> 00:12:51.740
Now go check out “SCP-1461 - House of the
Worm” and “SCP-2430 - Immortal Hitler

00:12:51.740 --> 00:12:54.480
Clone” for more terrifying wartime anomalies!

